{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And we will arm ourselves swiftly.</b> After we settle our women and our children, our livestock and our property across the Jordan, we will be able to run swiftly at the front, for we will have no weight or burden like the other tribes, who will bring along with them their heavy baggage, which is called harnais." "<b>Before the children of Israel.</b> Just as we took first, so we shall be first in war."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {0 "הרניי״ש is Old French harnais, 'harness, baggage, military equipment.'"}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:29.771140387Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}